  "translation": "Ndi Avshalomu analamula ⟨את⟩ anyamata ake, nati: “Penyerani ⟨ndithu⟩ pamene mtima wa Amnoni ukondwerera ndi vinyo, ndipo pamene ndidzati kwa inu: ‘Menyani ⟨את⟩ Amnoni, ndipo muphe ⟨את⟩ iye,’ musaope. Ndithu ayi? Ine ndine wakulamulirani ⟨את⟩ inu. Limbikani, ndipo khalanibe ana amphamvu.”",
